				<wikidot:authorName>A Random Day</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1841781</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Merry early Christmas.</p> <p>This is a collaborative log that is open for all to contribute to.<br /> It has only one rule: all incidents must occur on 22/11/1963. I may remove logs at my discretion, but logs that do not occur on 22/11/1963 will be edited so that they do.</p> <p>Have fun!</p> 
				 	]]>
